    subgraph BUILD["🔧 pricecheck.js — 22 born-RED proofs"]
        BD["DESIGN LAW: does NOT reimplement pricing.<br/>Loads prices.js + core.js + worldkitchen.js and calls<br/>the app's OWN wkParseIngredients / wkPriceLookup<br/>over base lines AND every version delta.<br/>Refuses to report if any gate file fails to load"]
        BS1["✅ EXACT — real key or real alias"]
        BS2["🔴 WRONG PRODUCT — HARD, 2 mechanical flags:<br/>count-key on a gram ingredient · key found<br/>ONLY in the prep/note tail"]
        BS3["🟠 REVIEW — qualifier beside the key. Prints, never blocks"]
        BS4["🔵 ABSENT — deduped by head, cross-read against MF152<br/>so a sourced key is never 'discovered' twice"]
        BD --> BS1 --> BS2 --> BS3 --> BS4
    end

